The job of an Affiliate Marketing Consultant involves managing the company’s external and internal affiliate programs through all phases, including brainstorming, launch, maintaining, trafficking, marketing, reporting, optimization and analysis. He/she is responsible for identifying, evaluating and recruiting new affiliates to increase program distribution and interfacing with internal marketing and other team to develop and implement marketing strategies and support affiliate programs. He/She will also be responsible for training our marketing team on various affiliate marketing strategies and initiatives.

Education/Experience Requirements
* A successful candidate must possess at least 3 years of experience as an affiliate marketer 

Skills
* Familiarity with affiliate marketing networks and search engine marketing;
* Proven record in negotiation and management of online media campaigns;
* Knowledge in ad-serving technologies, experience in campaign management;
* Excellent time management and project management skills;
* Strong organizational, planning, problem-solving, and decision-making skills, and the ability to multi-task, work under pressure and work well independently and in a team setting.

Specific work elements
* Maintaining and developing affiliate marketing programs, recruiting new affiliate partners;
* Monitoring affiliate practices; negotiating and evaluating affiliate advertising agreements;
* Maintaining relationships with affiliates and partners;

Overview

As a Node.js Developer, you will be responsible for delivering effective solutions with high-quality code. You will join a culturally diverse team, working in Scrum with CI/CD, in the spirit of the ‘fail fast, fail often’ agile concept.

If you’re interested in taking this challenging career opportunity within a growing international company, you’ll join a professional team. The development team uses a sophisticated tech stack with Node.js on the back end and React on the front end.

